      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 102 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(The Start of a New Week)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "For me, it is very hard to get out of bed every Monday morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "When my mother shouts at me to wake up, I don’t want to get up."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I want to stay in bed longer, and after a few minutes,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I finally get out of bed."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After I get up and prepare for school,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "the first day of my new week has started on this note."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        "1 번",
        "2 번",
        "3 번",
        "4 번",
        "5 번"
      ]
    },
